              "text": "successivamente — \"subsequently, after that (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Successivamente il treno è ripartito. Subsequently the train set off again."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal and common in reports and on the news; in everyday talk, poi."
            }
          ]
        },
